description: Standards for data normalization and transformation layer
globs: src/transform/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# Transform Layer Rules

- Keep transformation functions deterministic and side-effect free.
- Normalize headers to snake_case ASCII consistently.
- Maintain explicit source-to-target field mapping with versionable constants.
- Validate required columns before processing and fail fast with clear errors.
- Avoid embedding database or network concerns in transformation modules.

# Transform Tests

- Test normalization with accented and special-character headers.
- Test missing-required-column behavior.
- Test idempotency for repeated normalization runs.
